#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0660 expect=violation domain=ADNCA
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when METABFL is present with a value other than Y or null in an ADNCA v1.0 dataset (the METABFL codelist permits only Y or null).
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
dataset ADNCA
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col METABFL type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col NFRLT type=Num
col AFRLT type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | X | CONC | 0 | 0.5
---
